<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! sense.sensorium.hardens ~ an ephemeral sensorium turns durable

`lares sense harden <name> approve=true` runs on a person's hand at a real terminal: the house hand gate reads the command's own branch, and `--approve` names the intent. It hardens the named sensorium durable in its manifest, `--store-swap <target>` swapping its store as it does.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ harden

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`harden` params=`name/pioneer-1 approve/true ~ harden a sensorium`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ name · approve · store-swap

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`name` params=`takes/name needs/required seat/1 as/<name> ~ the sensorium named in the manifest`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`approve` params=`kind/switch ~ name the intent`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`store-swap` params=`takes/host-path ~ swap the store to this target as it hardens`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`hand` params=`who/hand ~ runs direct over manifest.json; a person at a real terminal, and the verb names its intent with --approve where it asks one`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ verb-error · hand-act-only

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`verb-error` params=`~ no name, no --approve, or the harden refused`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`hand-act-only` params=`~ a seat reached a hand verb; name the command for the operator`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ hardened

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`hardened` params=`exit/0 ~ the manifest after`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

